\subsubsection{Period $N = 8$}
The period $N=8$ is realised by $77$ parameter sets across $2\\times2$, $2\\times3$, $2\\times4$, $2\\times6$, $3\\times3$, $3\\times4$, $3\\times6$, $4\\times4$, $4\\times6$, $6\\times6$. The reflection parameters take values in $\{$0.1464$, $0.1716$, $0.2929$, $0.5000$, $0.5858$, $0.6667$\}$, and the phase parameters in $\{$0.3333\pi$, $0.5000\pi$, $0.6667\pi$, $0.7500\pi$, $1.0000\pi$, $1.3333\pi$, $2.0000\pi$\}$. This period is realised on a small set of highly symmetric
tori.
